***************************************************************** 9137 1451
 The evaluated nuclear data file for Pa-233 was produced within   9137 1451
 the scope of the IAEA co-ordinated research project (CRP) on     9137 1451
 "Evaluated Nuclear Data Files for the Thorium-Uranium Fuel       9137 1451
 Cycle", International Atomic Energy Agency, Vienna, Austria,     9137 1451
 (2002-2006). Further information is available on:                9137 1451
 "http://www-nds.iaea.org/Th-U/"                                  9137 1451
