 EVALUATION OF THE RESOLVED RESONANCE REGION FOR Pa-233.          9137 1451
                                                                  9137 1451
 Thermal cross-sections and Breit-Wigner parameters have been     9137 1451
 obtained for the representation of total cross-section energy    9137 1451
 dependence in the 0.01 to 107 eV region as a result of           9137 1451
 evaluating Pa-233 experimental capture cross-sections at         9137 1451
 E=0.0253 eV and Simpson's total cross-section measurements in    9137 1451
 the resolved resonance region [1].                               9137 1451
   The resonance parameters were revised by L. Leal [2] adding    9137 1451
 spin assignment to resonances where appropriate and converting   9137 1451
 the parameters to Reich-Moore formalism.                         9137 1451
                                                                  9137 1451
